																		Apologies to mobile users
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scarhaver" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2838541); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2838541&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606834550" alt="scarhaver" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2838541)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scarhaver" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2838541); return false;" >scarhaver</a></span> <span class="odate time_1535142274 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">24 Aug 2018 20:24</span>
														</div>
